const HOL={};function holidays(y){if(HOL[y])return HOL[y];const L=[];const nth=(m,dow,n)=>{const d=new Date(y,m,1);let c=0;while(true){if(d.getDay()===dow&&++c===n)return iso(d);d.setDate(d.getDate()+1)}};
 const last=(m,dow)=>{const d=new Date(y,m+1,0);while(d.getDay()!==dow)d.setDate(d.getDate()-1);return iso(d)};
 const fixed=(m,day)=>{const d=new Date(y,m,day);if(d.getDay()===6)d.setDate(d.getDate()-1);else if(d.getDay()===0)d.setDate(d.getDate()+1);return iso(d)};
 L.push(fixed(0,1),nth(0,1,3),nth(1,1,3),last(4,1),fixed(5,19),fixed(6,4),nth(8,1,1),nth(9,1,2),fixed(10,11),nth(10,4,4),fixed(11,25));
 const tg=pd(nth(10,4,4));L.push(iso(addD(tg,1)));return HOL[y]=new Set(L)}
const isBiz=d=>d.getDay()!==0&&d.getDay()!==6&&!holidays(d.getFullYear()).has(iso(d));
const rollBiz=d=>{const x=new Date(d);while(!isBiz(x))x.setDate(x.getDate()+1);return x};
